 ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(7)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/201910231809435380378.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Vonguru\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Strix BT is a very good headset at every level. From its great build quality to its comfort, it is difficult to find any negative points. [...] We will especially remember its excellente battery life, sound quality and easy functionalities that I believe make it the perfect headset for mobile or tablet while remaining convenient for both PC and consoles.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>06/24/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://vonguru.fr/2021/06/24/test-casque-asus-rog-strix-bt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1225/202011301316589410447.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"10/10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Latest in Tech\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>10/10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Overall, the ASUS ROG Strix GO BT is a great product that we highly recommend.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>AUSTRALIA</span> <span>09/14/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of 10/10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://latestintech.com/asus-rog-strix-go-bt-headset-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1225/202202171355041610023.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"MEF TECH Must Have\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      MEFTECH\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>MEF TECH Must Have</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you love to game on your way to work or enjoy having an immersive experience whilst playing at home, the ASUS ROG Strix Go BT is an excellent choice for you.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>AUSTRALIA</span> <span>08/09/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of MEF TECH Must Have\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.meftech.com.au/reviews/rog-strix-go-bt-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1323/202107091039577710990.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Lason Arena Gaming Performance Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Lason Arena Gaming\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Lason Arena Gaming Performance Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Overall, The ASUS ROG Strix Go BT Headset is a solid option for on-the-go gaming. Especially with its solid battery life, the Noise Cancellation features on both audio and microphone. But the problem is that the audio quality here is not really that great especially on this competitive market that this headset is competing.. And also the build quality, I am having doubts on the longevity of the headset if it’s foldable.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>PHILIPPINES</span> <span>06/17/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of Lason Arena Gaming Performance Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://lasonarenagaming.com/index.php/2021/06/17/asus-rog-strix-go-bt-wireless-gaming-headset-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202305151711162610331.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hynerd Score\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hynerd.it\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hynerd Score</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Strix Go BT are definitely among the most futuristic gaming headsets on the market. Recommended for both amateurs and professionals, they allow use for long hours without the need for charging and certainly without creating any discomfort while being worn. Highlights include: good audio quality, fast connection, design and light weight of the product. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>05/13/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of Hynerd Score\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hynerd.it/asus-rog-strix-go-bt-recensione-le-migliori-cuffie-da-gaming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202001302019265730157.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Toughie\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Funduk.ua\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Toughie</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Strix Go BT is an excellent and logical development of the series, and just something that has not yet been in it. If you need a high-quality gaming headset specifically for mobile devices, if the choice of gaming smartphones has seduced you so much that you purchased one of them and play quite often, then you definitely need it. And, of course, compatibility with consoles from all brands, as well as gaming laptops, captivates.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>06/16/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of Toughie\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://funduk.ua/technoblog/igrovaya-periferiya/obzor-igrovoy-garnitury-rog-strix-go-bt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202004030114132790596.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"AXE Platinum\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC AXE\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>AXE Platinum</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Strix Go BT is a gaming headset that offers a quality wireless listening experience for even more amazing gaming sessions.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>05/19/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Go BT Media review Award of AXE Platinum\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://axe.rs/hardver/periferije/rog-strix-go-bt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewTitle__0lBVH\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 class=\"pageVideo vnRogFont ProductAwardVideo__vnRogFontSize__n4Ouu\">Video review</h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(5)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContentScroll__+rpKV\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContainer__SWxvv\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"I offer a 3000€ setup to a subscriber (surprise)\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/-2H8OG7skVk/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType